@startuml
title Natally | Proposed atelier-first journey\n28 October 2026 - for discussion and sign-off
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF8F2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EEE8F6
skinparam activityBorderColor #695779
skinparam ArrowColor #695779
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF0CC

start
:Marketing: the real animated atelier;
:Create account or sign in;
if (Existing intake?) then (yes)
  :Restore actual chart and history;
else (no)
  :Onboard; calculate actual natal chart;
endif
:Enter expanded atelier directly\nNo compulsory paywall;
:Click chart / interact with room / ask a question;
if (Paid conversation requested\nand ROCHE available?) then (yes)
  :Synchronize one-hour key with current ROCHE;
  :Real reading: chart, horoscope, synastry, etc.\nSpeak through the existing voice engine;
  :Animate usage; settle debit in RevenueCat\nRefresh confirmed LED balance;
  :Every two completed answers:\nNatally offers a keepsake edition;
else (no)
  :Prewritten education + actual chart + first name\nNatally-isms; voice rendered on demand;
  :End each answer with a real-reading invitation;
endif
if (User accepts an invitation\nor selects a purchase sign/button?) then (yes)
  if (Chosen offer?) then (ROCHE)
    :Finite monthly credit pack default\nOne-time top-up available;
  else (keepsake)
    :One-time $9.99 + applicable tax\nPDF + interactive hosted atelier edition;
  endif
  :Show actual price, grant/deliverables, cadence\nHave a code? / Terms / Privacy;
  :User presses the priced purchase button;
  if (Android Play distribution?) then (yes)
    :RevenueCat Android SDK\nGoogle Play confirmation sheet;
  else (desktop / web)
    :RevenueCat Billing\nStripe card default;
  endif
  if (Payment outcome?) then (confirmed)
    :Payment confirmed\nWait for RevenueCat grant / edition access;
    if (Access ready?) then (yes)
      if (Credit purchase?) then (yes)
        :Refresh ROCHE and key allowance\nRestore conversation draft;
      else (keepsake)
        :Create local PDF + interactive SPA\nPublish via existing Zight contract;
        :Retain customer-linked artifact references\nReplay prior answers and charts;
      endif
    else (delayed)
      :Show activating / delivery pending\nRetry fulfillment without repurchase;
    endif
  else (cancel / pending / failure)
    :Show actual outcome\nKeep chart, history and draft;
  endif
else (no)
  :Keep exploring\nQuiet keepsake button remains;
endif
:Return to the same atelier and conversation\nLater sessions restore prior history;
stop

legend bottom
  Renewal grants, cancellation, refund, restore and one-hour key events are defined in PLAN.md.
  RevenueCat owns balances and purchases; Firebase owns operational history; Zight holds artifacts.
  Prices, exact token quantities and Play cross-app currency scope require explicit sign-off.
endlegend
@enduml
